# Upstream UI — plt-design-system

Shared UI, interaction and accessibility belong in this monorepo. Storefronts
and CMS UIs only pin a commit/package and wire Shopify or editorial data.

## Before changing UI

1. Read [packages/design-system/docs/upstream-ui-policy.md](packages/design-system/docs/upstream-ui-policy.md).
2. Update [packages/design-system/contracts/components.md](packages/design-system/contracts/components.md) when props, slots or `plt:*` events change.
3. Prefer Lit Web Components under `packages/web-components` for storefront controls; tokens/themes under `packages/design-system`.
4. Consider Liquid/Astro adapters in this monorepo when the public contract changes.

## Do not

- Expect consumers to hand-edit vendored bundles or `node_modules`.
- Ship a storefront-only fork of a shared control; extend the contract here.

## After merge

Consumers bump the pinned SHA (`@playlovetoys/platform` or `@playlovetoys/design-system`), install, and sync where required (Liquid: `npm run sync:plt`).
